<article class="env-lemma" id="06QM">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/06QM">Lemma <span data-tag="06QM">35.19.1</span>.</a> If $f : X \to Y$ is a flat and surjective morphism of schemes and $X$ is reduced, then $Y$ is reduced. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      The result follows by looking at local rings (Schemes, Definition <a href="/tag/01J0" data-tag="01J0">26.12.1</a>) and Algebra, Lemma <a href="/tag/033F" data-tag="033F">10.164.2</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>